  "notes": "APIv4 shape verified against the portal documentation (User Guide / API Examples / FAQ, read 2026-10-08): key as X-API-KEY query parameter, limit/offset paging, rate limit 10 requests per 10 minutes — this module makes one request per weekly run. The legacy api.dol.gov/V1 endpoint uniformly rejected the portal-issued key (HTTP 400 on all routes) and is not documented by the portal; superseded. Scope: United States (national — ETA ui_national_weekly_claims dataset is the national series; no state split). Field mapping verified against the dataset metadata endpoint (2026-10-08): rptdate=week-ending date, c4=initial NSA, c5=initial SA, c6=continued NSA, c7=continued SA, c3=covered employment; c1/c2 are seasonal factors (excluded), c8/c9 are SA 4-week moving averages (not carried)."
